  "description": ".NET for Android / .NET MAUI bindings for the OpenTracing Java API - opentracing-api, opentracing-noop and opentracing-util 0.32.0, the tracing interfaces the Datadog Android SDK 2.x is built on: Tracer, Span, SpanContext, Scope, ScopeManager and GlobalTracer. Built to accompany dd-sdk-android 2.26.3. Arrives as a dependency of DatadogNet.Trace.Android; reference it directly to hold an ITracer or ISpan of your own. Note that dd-sdk-android 3.0 dropped OpenTracing entirely, so this package belongs to the 2.x line only.",
